Que 10 :
========

class Sample3{
 public static void main(String[] args)
 {
 int i = 100;
 long l = i;
 float f = l;
 System.out.println("Int value " + i);
 System.out.println("Long value " + l);
 System.out.println("Float value " + f);
 }
}

Output:

Int value 100
Long value 100
Float value 100.0
=================================================

