Que 3 :
=======

Write a java program to find the profit and loss by following the formula
Profit and loss Formulas – 
Profit = SP – CP
Loss = CP – SP
Profit percentage = (Profit /Cost Price) x 100
Loss percentage = (Loss / Cost price) x 100